## 性能優化

### ⚡ 查詢優化技巧

#### 1. 使用 CTE 避免重複計算

```sql
WITH conversation_data AS (
    SELECT c.id, c.item_id, ...
    FROM public.conversations c
    WHERE ...
),
last_messages AS (
    SELECT DISTINCT ON (cm.conversation_id)
        cm.conversation_id, cm.content, cm.sent_at
    FROM public.conversation_messages cm
    WHERE cm.deleted_at IS NULL
    ORDER BY cm.conversation_id, cm.sent_at DESC
)
SELECT ... FROM conversation_data cd
LEFT JOIN last_messages lm ON lm.conversation_id = cd.id;
```

#### 2. 索引優化未讀訊息查詢

```sql
-- 部分索引:只索引未讀訊息,減少索引大小
CREATE INDEX idx_conversation_messages_unread
ON public.conversation_messages(conversation_id, sender_id, is_read)
WHERE is_read = false;
```

#### 3. 分頁查詢

```sql
-- 使用 LIMIT/OFFSET 避免一次載入過多資料
LIMIT p_size OFFSET (p_page - 1) * p_size;
```

### 📊 性能監控建議

```sql
-- 檢查索引使用率
SELECT
    schemaname,
    tablename,
    indexname,
    idx_scan,
    idx_tup_read,
    idx_tup_fetch
FROM pg_stat_user_indexes
WHERE tablename IN ('conversations', 'conversation_messages')
ORDER BY idx_scan DESC;

-- 檢查慢查詢
SELECT
    query,
    calls,
    total_exec_time,
    mean_exec_time
FROM pg_stat_statements
WHERE query LIKE '%conversations%'
ORDER BY mean_exec_time DESC
LIMIT 10;
```

